    </span></td>
    <td style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
    impact on our operations and value of our Class A Shares by PRC government&#8217;s significant oversight, control, intervention and/or
    influence over our business operation;</span></td></tr>
