    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Our continued investing
    in technology, resources, and new business capabilities;</span></td></tr>
  </table><div>
</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;">
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td style="width: 48px"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></td>
