</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Sample
research and development projects from 2023 to 2025 include the following:</span></p><div>

