></tr> <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)"> <td style="text-align: left; text-indent: -9pt; padding-left: 9pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Zhangjiakou ReTo Intelligent Equipment Manufacturing Co., Ltd. (&#8220;Zhangjiakou ReTo&#8221;)**</span></td><td><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></td> <td style="text-align: center"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c78" id="ix_3_fact" name="us-gaap:SubsidiaryOfLimitedLiabilityCompanyOrLimitedPartnershipState"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Hebei, China</span></ix:nonNumeric></td><td><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></td> <td style="text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></td><td style="text-align: right"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c78" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SubsidiaryOfLimitedLiabilityCompanyOrLimitedPartnershipOwnershipInterest" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-30040">100</ix:nonFraction></span></td><td style="text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">%</span></td></tr> <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; "> <td style="text-align: left; text-indent: -9pt; padding-left: 9pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Beijing ReTo Hengye Technology Co., Ltd. (&#8220;ReTo Hengye&#8221;)*</span></td><td><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></td> <td style="text-align: center"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c79" id="ix_1_fact" name="us-gaap:SubsidiaryOfLimitedLiabilityCompanyOrLimitedPartnershipState"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Beijing, China</span></ix:nonNumeric></td><td><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></td> <td style="text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#1