<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">The
Company records transactions with various related parties. These related party balances as of December 31, 2025 and 2024 and transactions
for the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023 are identified as follows:</span></p>

